{"slug":"FRONTLINES-I-Aimbot-86980","_id":"696c1f1d242dea933cdb43b2","title":"CattoHub I Aimbot","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d68","gameId":5938036553,"name":"FRONTLINES","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":5938036553},"features":"1. Smooth Aimbot with Target Lock\n\nUnlike janky aimbots that snap instantly (obvious cheating), CattoHub smooths the aim\nTarget persistence system - once locked on, it stays on target even if they move\nCustomizable FOV circle so you control how aggressive it is\nOnly activates when holding right-click for natural gameplay\n\n2. Smart Dead Detection System\n\nOther scripts still highlight dead players, wasting your time\nCattoHub uses advanced weapon-drop detection to instantly gray out dead enemies\nNo more shooting at corpses - saves ammo and reveals your position\n\n3. Rainbow Chams ESP\n\nMost scripts have static colored ESP that's boring and hard to see\nCattoHub has smooth rainbow transitions that look amazing and are easier to spot\nWorks through walls so you always know where enemies are\n\n4. Clean PlayStation UI\n\nMost scripts have ugly, cluttered interfaces\nCattoHub uses a sleek PlayStation-style menu that's easy to navigate\nEverything organized into clear tabs (ESP, Aimbot, Misc)\n\n5. Performance Optimized\n\nRuns smoothly without FPS drops\nSmart cleanup systems prevent memory leaks\nWon't slow down your game like bloated scripts\n\n6. Extra Features\n\nFull Bright - See in dark areas clearly\nNo Clip - Walk through anything\n\nWhy Join the Discord?\n\nReport bugs and get help\nSuggest new features\nEarly access to updates\nMeet other users","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kyro-scripts/cattohub/refs/heads/main/FrontLines%202\"))()","owner":{"_id":"68ced2605ab598fdf72284e3","username":"CattoHub","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":